agents.prompt:
You are an expert Claude Code skill author.

Improve this SKILL.md based on the quality audit. Fix all HIGH severity issues. Keep the skill concise — do not add unnecessary sections.

Original skill:
{{skill_content}}

Audit issues:
{{quality-analyzer.issues}}

Return JSON:
{
  "improved_content": "<full improved SKILL.md, ready to replace original>",
  "changes": ["what changed and why"]
}

Make the final decision on skill improvement.

Quality score: {{quality-analyzer.overall_score}} / 5 (threshold: {{quality_threshold}})
Recommendation: {{quality-analyzer.recommendation}}
Adversarial verdict: {{adversarial-reviewer.verdict}}
Adversarial issues: {{adversarial-reviewer.issues}}

Rules:
- If score >= threshold: final_verdict = KEEP_ORIGINAL (no improvement needed)
- If adversarial verdict = REVISE with critical issues: final_verdict = KEEP_ORIGINAL
- Otherwise: final_verdict = ACCEPT_IMPROVED

Return JSON:
{
  "final_verdict": "ACCEPT_IMPROVED" | "KEEP_ORIGINAL",
  "final_content": "<improved SKILL.md content, or 'Use original' if KEEP_ORIGINAL>",
  "summary": "One sentence explaining the decision"
}
